{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09973","headline":"和李起居秋夜之作 · 薛奇童","name":"和李起居秋夜之作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"过庭闻礼日，趋侍记言回。\n独卧玉窗前，卷帘残雨来。\n高秋南斗转，凉夜北堂开。\n水影入朱户，萤光生绿苔。\n简成良史笔，年是洛阳才。\n莫重白云意，时人许上台。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛奇童","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09973.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09973","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}